      "summary": "# 5-Line Summary\n\n1. **Initial Request**: User asked to implement a floating expansion feature for tasks in collapsed sidebar mode, where all tasks are visible as icons but expand on hover.\n\n2. **Solution Design**: Created a two-mode display system where compact mode shows icon-only nodes and expanded mode displays full node content with descriptions and action buttons.\n\n3. **Floating Popup Implementation**: Added a fixed-position floating container in compact mode that appears on hover, displaying full task details, descriptions, message counts, and action buttons (add/delete).\n\n4. **Component Structure**: Modified both `ChatSidebar.vue` and `ChatSidebarNode.vue` to support compact rendering with recursive child nodes visible in the floating popup when expanded.\n\n5. **User Experience**: Implemented smooth hover behavior with timeout delays and nested children support in the floating view, allowing users to navigate task hierarchies without leaving the compact sidebar state.",
